# 1. Executive Summary

This Engineering Specification establishes the standardized Request and Response Schema architecture for the CodeSense AI backend.

The objective is to ensure every API exposed by the platform follows a consistent, predictable, and strongly typed contract.

Every endpoint developed in future phases SHALL consume request schemas and return response schemas defined under this architecture.

Raw dictionaries or untyped responses are prohibited.

