# 6. API Response Philosophy

Every endpoint SHALL return one of two formats:

## Success

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Operation completed successfully.",
    "data": {},
    "metadata": {}
}
```

---

## Error

```json
{
    "success": false,
    "error": {
        "code": "RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND",
        "message": "Project not found.",
        "details": []
    }
}
```

No endpoint may invent its own response format.

